	(text "Primary microcontroller. Manages all hardware peripherals (I2C, SPI, Timers, Differential ADC) for high-speed sensor acquisition, ESC PWM generation, and real-time control logic."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 96.012 156.21 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.9 0.9)
			)
		)
		(uuid "653297c1-d54f-407b-b961-be1bbb728dd4")
	)
	(text "Main power distribution network. Converts raw input voltage into stable $5\\text{V}$ and $3.3\\text{V}$ logic rails via dual regulators for the MCU and sensors, while providing direct high-current \npassthrough to the ESC and motor terminals."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.988 266.446 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.9 0.9)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "726f291c-3350-44a9-b68e-62ee77168801")
	)
	(text "STM32F407\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 41.402 40.386 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.27 2.27)
				(thickness 0.454)
				(bold yes)
			)
		)
		(uuid "8feefe83-ade1-46ac-afaf-ff3209141bea")
	)
	(text "ESC\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 149.098 184.404 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "94f14fa8-a9dd-4477-a07e-2603b8295bbe")
	)
	(text "Galvanically isolated output stage. Employs optocouplers driven by the STM32 (PD12, PD13, PD14) to safely trigger external industrial hardware \nwithout exposing the logic board to voltage spikes or ground loops."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 185.42 264.414 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.9 0.9)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "9af5868a-3c68-486d-accf-b93918c3b7ed")
	)
	(text "SENSOR BOARD\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 53.086 22.098 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 3.27 3.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "a143fe9c-c298-4bdf-a746-6759db3b4b88")
	)
	(text "Diagnostic visual feedback array. Eight discrete LEDs with dedicated current-limiting resistors, mapped directly to STM32 GPIO pins for real-time \nfirmware state visualization and debugging."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 298.196 240.284 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.9 0.9)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "a78c8d92-2de5-4096-a67a-27858c2a1e59")
	)
	(text "POWER"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 36.322 170.688 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.27 2.27)
				(thickness 0.454)
				(bold yes)
			)
		)
		(uuid "ae5a7d2c-141e-4cb8-b76e-6574117398f8")
	)
	(text "Wireless co-processor. Interfaces directly with the STM32 via a serial UART connection (PB10/PB11) to handle external telemetry, wireless data \nlogging, or network communication."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 183.388 155.702 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.9 0.9)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "c04ffd2e-2d51-410d-9336-146f0a325fe5")
	)
	(text "Integrated BLDC motor driven by hardware PWM, featuring dual rotary feedback (HC-020K optical and AS5600 magnetic encoders). Pneumatic syringe system \ncoupled to an MD0535 (HX710B) 24-bit pressure sensor, accompanied by an HX711-amplified aluminum load cell and a linear Time-of-Flight sensor track. \nFront panel includes standard rotary, wire-wound, and digital potentiometers. All sensors are hard-routed to native MCU peripherals (I2C, SPI, Timers, \nDifferential ADC).\n\nPower via main block terminal. 5V distribution to modular sensor PCBs with strict 3.3V logic regulation for ADC safety on potentiometers and load cell \nexcitation. Custom baseplate with modular JST XH routing."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 294.386 91.44 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.9 0.9)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "e10fdbfc-b2bd-42f7-bfad-5c473e121374")
	)
